    "text": "(I. Kapovich, P. Schupp). Is there an algorithm which, when given two\nelements u, v of a free group Fn , decides whether or not the cyclic length of ϕ(u)\nequals the cyclic length of ϕ(v) for every automorphism ϕ of Fn ?\n   Comment of 2009: The answer was shown to be positive for n = 2 in (D. Lee,\nJ. Group Theory, 10 (2007), 561–569).                                V. E. Shpilrain",
